    "body": "The retained geometric context producer still used unrestricted learned coefficients, and answer credit from its downstream geometric consumers needed to follow the current native state and observation choices. This adds strict packed-q4 context transition/readout artifacts, authoritative native-conditioned recurrence, and full ordinary-answer input credit through frozen values/composition, NoRead, and directed compatibility.\n\nAll nine context families use fixed q/4 units and pinned Q25 observation basis; exact H4 transport remains distinct. Latent state, raw emitted root and category/absence remain separate. The source/native six-file inventories, parameter-bit identities and dependency rebinding remain strict, while legacy four-file artifacts retain their format. Frozen downstream coefficients are detached from the graph. Actual age/NoRead-inclusive causal normalization and hard native packets drive the offline learning graph.\n\nBoth zero-update saved-parent constructions completed: **446/512 answers versus478/512 parent,13 gains/45 losses**, with all512 source/native answers/hard traces agreeing and all four CE panels worse. All nine families receive finite answer gradients; isolated consumer cuts preserve hard-logit bits, and all-cut disconnects context. The long diagnostic batches have much larger transition norms, so these checks establish connected credit, not fit readiness. All changed rows, parent/native payload traces, exact RNGs and failed attempts are preserved. The plan advances persistent integer attention assembly without automatic context recovery training or a geometry-family rejection.\n\nValidation executed on the construction source:15 focused cases (integer4; context5; consumer-credit5; strict-context/value admission1), two release example builds, both actual workers33.897/25.181s at0.76/0.74GB RSS, direct formatting, claim wording and diff checks. Retained failures are a missing typed-endpoint initializer and a legacy-only context admission guard, both repaired with appropriate focused validation. Actual source/executable/report identities are in the receipt.\n\nCombined source preserves Claude's merged Metal work and sequencing scripts. Six context/admission and five credit cases passed again, the release driver rebuilt, and the unchanged seed-1 replay completed in19.393s at0.802GB RSS. All seven saved row/episode/prefix files and numerical panel/gradient/route/RNG records match the earlier candidate exactly. This is coexistence validation, not another quality draw.\n\nIndependent reviews checked all512 joined saved rows, reconstructed1,024 query-head weight/denominator traces, verified frozen coefficient and artifact bindings, and reviewed all ten combined-source paths. Of45 losses,28 retain a correct-source majority in at least one head and19 retain mass at least0.9; all45 target payloads change. These simultaneous changes do not isolate a causal explanation. Reviews approve the scoped implementation while retaining the quality regressions and biased-gradient limitations.\n\nAll217 research files (524767600 bytes) are frozen and independently SHA256-verified after cloud preservation. The cloud archive is525449216 bytes at `icloud:UOR-R4/results/codex/geometric-context-q4-20261002.tar`, with verified upload/download MD5 `9c6a071a8af32ceb028872dd0ae18c8f`. Source head10a4caef received independent combined-source approval; the final delivery commit changes result documentation only.\n\nEvent/age coefficient width, selected access, float trunk/output and natural-input/session language capability remain unfinished. The new coefficient components do not establish complete compliant serving, general language or energy savings. `stack_grounded_session.rs` is untouched; existing Metal ownership remains preserved. Offline donor/operator compilation remains available.\n\nReferences #1512, #973, #820.\n",
